s? If so, though, I think it needs to be communicated better - right now it looks to me like there are two checkboxes for the same setting, and highlighting the checkbox simply shows the documentation for the property it's next to.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd multiple WAV files to a Godot project, then highlight them all in the FileSystem tab and open the Import tab.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nDon't have one at the moment, but will try to put one together soon.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107519/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}